FullHpRecoveryControl.Description:
Full HP Recovery behavior override. 
            //Enable =[true or false] -control switch 
            //TriggerWhenHpPercent =[0.0 - 1.0] -0.0 means never trigger, overriding system trigger when the player's hp is equal or less that the value
            //RecoveryHpMinPercent =[0.0 - 1.0] -minimum HP % that player can recover 
            //RecoveryHpMaxPercent =[0.0 - 1.0] -maximum HP % that player can recover

ReflectDamageControl.Description:
Control Reflect Damage output. 
            //Enable =[true or false] -control switch 
            //ReflectDmgOutputPercent =[0.0 - 1.0] -multiply the reflect damage output to this value; disable value: 0.0, default value: 1.0

ExcellentDamageControl.Description:
Control Excellent Damage output. 
            //Enable =[true or false] -control switch 
            //ExcellentChancePercent =[0.0 - 1.0] -control the changes; disable value: 0.0, default value=1.0
